      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay thanks. i'll grab a bucket. \n\nonce i get it unscrewed and see what's inside, what am i actually looking for? like is there a specific kind of buildup that's most common, or should i just be looking for anything that looks like a solid chunk blocking it?",
